<Layout title="Cancellation & Refund Policy — Rakhi Battle by BondBop" noindex>
  <article class="shell legal">
    <h1>Cancellation & Refund Policy</h1>
    <p>Last updated: 26 August 2026.</p>
    <p>Rakhi Battle is a BondBop game operated in India by Divya Pandey. Support: <a href="mailto:support@bondbop.com">support@bondbop.com</a>.</p>
    <h2>Digital products and cancellation</h2>
    <p>Paid upgrades are digital products delivered immediately after verified payment. Because fulfilment starts at once, a change-of-mind cancellation is not ordinarily available after the purchased content has been successfully unlocked and delivered.</p>
    <h2>Duplicate charge, failed or deficient delivery</h2>
    <p>If you are charged more than once for the same battle, a verified payment does not unlock the purchased content, or the digital service is defective, deficient or materially different from what was advertised, submit a <a href="/contact">support request</a> or email <a href="mailto:support@bondbop.com">support@bondbop.com</a>. Include the battle code and payment reference. After verification, an eligible refund or other appropriate redressal will be provided to the original payment method; bank or payment-provider processing time may apply.</p>
    <h2>Consumer rights</h2>
    <p>Nothing in this policy limits any non-waivable right or remedy available to you under applicable consumer law. The 7-day contact window we may request for faster investigation does not extinguish a statutory right that applies for a longer period.</p>
    <h2>Safety</h2>
    <p>Never send a UPI PIN, OTP, full card number or online-banking password. We do not need these to investigate a payment.</p>
  </article>
</Layout>
